flowchart TD
  REQ[Home page request] --> CG[Candidate generation · ~1,000<br/>item neighbours · vector ANN · trending · follows]
  CG --> RK[Ranking model<br/>features from the feature store]
  RK --> RR[Re-ranking<br/>diversity · freshness · rules]
  RR --> OUT[Top 20 shown<br/>impressions logged]
  OUT --> EV{{Event stream}}
  EV --> FS[(Feature store)]
  EV --> LAKE[(Training logs)]
  LAKE --> TR[Offline training<br/>CF neighbours · embeddings · ranker]
  FS -. fresh features .-> RK
  TR -. publishes indexes .-> CG
  TR -. publishes model .-> RK
